<title>SINGAPORE: IOC issues tender to buy 14,000/T May fuel oil.</title>
<headline>IOC issues tender to buy 14,000/T May fuel oil.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has issued a tender to buy 14,000 tonnes of 3.5-percent sulphur fuel oil for May loading, industry sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>IOC seeks to buy the 180-cst grade cargo for lifting May 5-8 to Mangalore or Goa on the Indian west coast, the sources said.</p>
<p>The tender closes April 23 and offers should be valid until April 24.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703571)</p>
</text>
